DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/resource-library/applications/{id}
Delete a custom application and all of its versions. Deletion is rejected when other resources reference the application.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; id (path) — Application ID.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/resource-library/applications/{id}
Get application by ID.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; id (path) — Application ID.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/resource-library/categories/{id}
Get application category by ID.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; id (path) — Application category ID.

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/resource-library/applications/{id}
Replace the network matchers for a custom application and create a new version.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; id (path) — Application ID.; body (body)
